#: ../../security/mor22072101.rst:4
msgid "MOR20220721-01"
msgstr "MOR20220721-01"

#: ../../security/mor22072101.rst:6
msgid "**Advisory ID:** MOR20220721-01"
msgstr "**Advisory ID:** MOR20220721-01"

#: ../../security/mor22072101.rst:7
msgid "**CVSSv3 Range:** 9.8"
msgstr "**CVSSv3 Range:** 9.8"

#: ../../security/mor22072101.rst:8
msgid "**Issue Date:** 07-21-2022"
msgstr "**Issue Date:** 07-21-2022"

#: ../../security/mor22072101.rst:9
msgid "**Updated On:** 07-21-2022"
msgstr "**Updated On:** 07-21-2022"

#: ../../security/mor22072101.rst:10
msgid "**CVE(s):** CVE-2022-35912"
msgstr "**CVE(s):** CVE-2022-35912"

#: ../../security/mor22072101.rst:11
msgid ""
"**Synopsis:** In grails-databinding in Grails before 3.3.15, 4.x before "
"4.1.1, 5.x before 5.1.9, and 5.2.x before 5.2.1 (at least when certain "
"Java 8 configurations are used), data binding allows a remote attacker to"
" execute code by gaining access to the class loader."
msgstr "**Synopsis:** Em grails-databinding no Grails anterior a 3.3.15, 4.x anterior a 4.1.1, 5.x anterior a 5.1.9 e 5.2.x anterior a 5.2.1 (pelo menos quando certas configurações de Java 8 são usadas), o data binding permite que um invasor remoto execute código obtendo acesso ao class loader."

#: ../../security/mor22072101.rst:14
msgid "Impacted Product Versions"
msgstr "Versões de Produto Impactadas"

#: ../../security/mor22072101.rst:16
msgid ""
"|morpheus| through 5.4.3 (which run Java 8) are confirmed to be impacted,"
" |morpheus| through 5.5.1-1 (for customers on 5.5.x Standard "
"installations) and 5.4.8-2 (for customers on 5.4.x LTS installations) are"
" potentially impacted if the vulnerability is found on Java 11."
msgstr "|morpheus| até 5.4.3 (que executam Java 8) estão confirmados como impactados; |morpheus| até 5.5.1-1 (para clientes em instalações Standard 5.5.x) e 5.4.8-2 (para clientes em instalações LTS 5.4.x) estão potencialmente impactados se a vulnerabilidade for encontrada no Java 11."

#: ../../security/mor22072101.rst:19
msgid "Advisory Details"
msgstr "Detalhes do Advisory"

#: ../../security/mor22072101.rst:21
msgid ""
"**Description**: Morpheus v5.5.1-2, v5.5.1-3 and v5.4.8-2 are now "
"available in response to CVE-3022-35912, a Grails Framework remote code "
"execution vulnerability. Morpheus v5.5.1-2, v5.5.1-3 and v5.4.8-2 include"
" the Grails v5.1.9 update that mitigates CVE-3022-35912. At this time, "
"the CVE-3022-35912 vulnerability is only confirmed for Grails frameworks "
"running on Java 8. Morpheus versions v5.4.4 and higher use Java 11. "
"Appliances running v5.4.3 or earlier are highly advised to be upgraded to"
" v5.4.4 or higher, and out of an abundance of caution we recommend all "
"customers upgrade all Morpheus Appliances to v5.5.1-3 or v5.4.8-2 in the "
"event the vulnerability is found to be exploitable on Java 11."
msgstr "**Description**: Morpheus v5.5.1-2, v5.5.1-3 e v5.4.8-2 já estão disponíveis em resposta ao CVE-3022-35912, uma vulnerabilidade de execução remota de código no Grails Framework. Morpheus v5.5.1-2, v5.5.1-3 e v5.4.8-2 incluem a atualização do Grails v5.1.9 que mitiga o CVE-3022-35912. No momento, a vulnerabilidade CVE-3022-35912 está confirmada apenas para frameworks Grails em execução no Java 8. As versões Morpheus v5.4.4 e superiores usam Java 11. Appliances em execução na v5.4.3 ou anterior são altamente recomendados a serem atualizados para v5.4.4 ou superior e, por precaução, recomendamos que todos os clientes atualizem todos os Appliances Morpheus para v5.5.1-3 ou v5.4.8-2 caso a vulnerabilidade seja considerada explorável no Java 11."

#: ../../security/mor22072101.rst:22
msgid ""
"**Resolution**: Upgrade |morpheus| appliance at least to version 5.4.4 or"
" higher (which all use Java 11), however, out of an abundance of caution,"
" we recommend customers upgrade to |morpheus| 5.5.1-3+ (Standard) or "
"5.4.8-2+ (LTS) in case the vulnerability is found to be exploitable in "
"Java 11."
msgstr "**Resolution**: Atualize o appliance |morpheus| pelo menos para a versão 5.4.4 ou superior (que todas usam Java 11); no entanto, por precaução, recomendamos que os clientes atualizem para |morpheus| 5.5.1-3+ (Standard) ou 5.4.8-2+ (LTS) caso a vulnerabilidade seja considerada explorável no Java 11."

